                "q": "Write the following sets in tabular form.\n(i) A = Set of all integers between -3 and 3\n(ii) B = Set of composite numbers less than 11\n(iii) C = {x | x ∈ P ∧ 5 < x ≤ 13}\n(iv) D = {y | y ∈ O ∧ 7 < y < 17}\n(v) E = {z | z ∈ R ∧ z^2 = 121}\n(vi) F = {p | p ∈ Q ∧ p^2 = -1}"
