                "a": "(i) A ∪ B = {a, b, c, d, e, i, o, u}\nB ∪ A = {a, b, c, d, e, i, o, u}\nA ∪ B = B ∪ A\nA ∩ B = {a, e}\nB ∩ A = {a, e}\nA ∩ B = B ∩ A\n(ii) P = {-2, -1, 0, 1, 2}\nQ = {2, 4}\nP ∪ Q = {-2, -1, 0, 1, 2, 4}\nQ ∪ P = {-2, -1, 0, 1, 2, 4}\nP ∪ Q = Q ∪ P\nP ∩ Q = {2}\nQ ∩ P = {2}\nP ∩ Q = Q ∩ P",
                "q": "Verify the commutative property of union and intersection for the following sets.\n(i) A = {a, b, c, d, e} and B = {a, e, i, o, u}\n(ii) P = {x | x ∈ Z ∧ -3 < x < 3} and Q = {y | y ∈ E+ ∧ y ≤ 4}"
