                "q": "Examine whether the following algebraic expressions are polynomials or not.\n(i) 2xy^2 - 3x^2 + 5y^3 - 6 (ii) 3xy^-2\n(iii) 6x^2 - 10x + 7 - √45 (iv) 5√x - x + 5x^2\n(v) [[2/(x+2)]] (vi) [[2/x]] + x^3 - 2"
