                "a": "10^3 = 10 x 10 x 10 = 1000\n20^3 = 20 x 20 x 20 = 8000\n30^3 = 30 x 30 x 30 = 27000\n40^3 = 40 x 40 x 40 = 64000\n50^3 = 50 x 50 x 50 = 125000\n60^3 = 60 x 60 x 60 = 216000\n8^3 = 8 x 8 x 8 = 512\n12^3 = 12 x 12 x 12 = 1728\n15^3 = 15 x 15 x 15 = 3375\n18^3 = 18 x 18 x 18 = 5832\n24^3 = 24 x 24 x 24 = 13824\n25^3 = 25 x 25 x 25 = 15625"
