              {
                "q": "Examine whether the following are perfect cubes or not.\n1. 512  2. 729  3. 3,375  4. 1,728  5. 64  6. 125\n7. 4,096  8. 5,832  9. 9,261  10. 27,000  11. 32,768  12. 39,304  13. 1.728",
                "a": "1. 512\n2 | 512\n2 | 256\n2 | 128\n2 | 64\n2 | 32\n2 | 16\n2 | 8\n2 | 4\n2 | 2\n| 1\n512 = 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2\n512 = 2^3 x 2^3 x 2^3 = 8^3\nYes\n2. 729\n3 | 729\n3 | 243\n3 | 81\n3 | 27\n3 | 9\n3 | 3\n| 1\n729 = 3 x 3 x 3 x 3 x 3 x 3\n729 = 3^3 x 3^3 = 9^3\nYes\n3. 3375\n3 | 3375\n3 | 1125\n3 | 375\n5 | 125\n5 | 25\n5 | 5\n| 1\n3375 = 3 x 3 x 3 x 5 x 5 x 5\n3375 = 3^3 x 5^3 = 15^3\nYes\n4. 1728\n2 | 1728\n2 | 864\n2 | 432\n2 | 216\n2 | 108\n2 | 54\n3 | 27\n3 | 9\n3 | 3\n| 1\n1728 = 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 3 x 3 x 3\n1728 = 2^3 x 2^3 x 3^3 = 12^3\nYes\n5. 64\n2 | 64\n2 | 32\n2 | 16\n2 | 8\n2 | 4\n2 | 2\n| 1\n64 = 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2\n64 = 2^3 x 2^3 = 4^3\nYes\n6. 125\n5 | 125\n5 | 25\n5 | 5\n| 1\n125 = 5 x 5 x 5\n125 = 5^3\nYes\n7. 4096\n2 | 4096\n2 | 2048\n2 | 1024\n2 | 512\n2 | 256\n2 | 128\n2 | 64\n2 | 32\n2 | 16\n2 | 8\n2 | 4\n2 | 2\n| 1\n4096 = 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2\n4096 = 2^3 x 2^3 x 2^3 x 2^3 = 16^3\nYes\n8. 5832\n2 | 5832\n2 | 2916\n2 | 1458\n3 | 729\n3 | 243\n3 | 81\n3 | 27\n3 | 9\n3 | 3\n| 1\n5832 = 2 x 2 x 2 x 3 x 3 x 3 x 3 x 3 x 3\n5832 = 2^3 x 3^3 x 3^3 = 18^3\nYes\n9. 9261\n3 | 9261\n3 | 3087\n3 | 1029\n7 | 343\n7 | 49\n7 | 7\n| 1\n9261 = 3 x 3 x 3 x 7 x 7 x 7\n9261 = 3^3 x 7^3 = 21^3\nYes\n10. 27000\n2 | 27000\n2 | 13500\n2 | 6750\n3 | 3375\n3 | 1125\n3 | 375\n5 | 125\n5 | 25\n5 | 5\n| 1\n27000 = 2 x 2 x 2 x 3 x 3 x 3 x 5 x 5 x 5\n27000 = 2^3 x 3^3 x 5^3 = 30^3\nYes\n11. 32768\n2 | 32768\n2 | 16384\n2 | 8192\n2 | 4096\n2 | 2048\n2 | 1024\n2 | 512\n2 | 256\n2 | 128\n2 | 64\n2 | 32\n2 | 16\n2 | 8\n2 | 4\n2 | 2\n| 1\n32768 = 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2\n32768 = 2^3 x 2^3 x 2^3 x 2^3 x 2^3 = 32^3\nYes\n12. 39304\n2 | 39304\n2 | 19652\n2 | 9826\n17 | 4913\n17 | 289\n17 | 17\n| 1\n39304 = 2 x 2 x 2 x 17 x 17 x 17\n39304 = 2^3 x 17^3 = 34^3\nYes\n13. 1.728\n1.728 = [[1728/1000]]\nNumerator: 1728\n2 | 1728\n2 | 864\n2 | 432\n2 | 216\n2 | 108\n2 | 54\n3 | 27\n3 | 9\n3 | 3\n| 1\n1728 = 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 3 x 3 x 3 = 2^3 x 2^3 x 3^3 = 12^3\nDenominator: 1000\n2 | 1000\n2 | 500\n2 | 250\n5 | 125\n5 | 25\n5 | 5\n| 1\n1000 = 2 x 2 x 2 x 5 x 5 x 5 = 2^3 x 5^3 = 10^3\n1.728 = (1.2)^3\nYes"
              }
