                "a": "(i) 3x + 1\nConstants: 3, 1\nVariables: x\nLiterals: x\n(ii) 0\nConstants: 0\nVariables: –\nLiterals: –\n(iii) 2a^2 + [[1/3]]b - 3\nConstants: 2, [[1/3]], -3, a, b\nVariables: –\nLiterals: a, b\n(iv) 3l - 2m\nConstants: 3, -2, l, m\nVariables: –\nLiterals: l, m\n(v) a + b^2 - 2c + 4\nConstants: -2, 4, a, b, c\nVariables: –\nLiterals: a, b, c\n(vi) px + qy + r\nConstants: p, q, r\nVariables: x, y\nLiterals: p, q, r, x, y\n(vii) -5x + 9y - 4\nConstants: -5, 9, -4\nVariables: x, y\nLiterals: x, y\n(viii) 3^2 p - 2^2 q\nConstants: 3^2, -2^2, p, q\nVariables: –\nLiterals: p, q\n(ix) y^2 - y - 1\nConstants: 1, -1\nVariables: y\nLiterals: y\n(x) √3 a - 9ab + √5\nConstants: √3, √5, -9, a, b\nVariables: –\nLiterals: a, b\n(xi) 7x^2 - 2x + 3\nConstants: 7, -2, 3\nVariables: x\nLiterals: x\n(xii) -8\nConstants: -8\nVariables: –\nLiterals: –"
