                "a": "(x - [[1/x]])^2 = (5)^2\nx^2 - 2 + [[1/x^2]] = 25\nx^2 + [[1/x^2]] = 27\n(x^2 + [[1/x^2]])^2 = (27)^2\nx^4 + 2 + [[1/x^4]] = 729\nx^4 + [[1/x^4]] = 727\n(x + [[1/x]])^2 = x^2 + 2 + [[1/x^2]] = 29\nx + [[1/x]] = √29\nx^4 - [[1/x^4]] = (x^2 + [[1/x^2]])(x^2 - [[1/x^2]])\nx^2 - [[1/x^2]] = (x - [[1/x]])(x + [[1/x]]) = 5√29\nx^4 - [[1/x^4]] = 27 × 5√29 = 135√29\nx^3 + [[1/x^3]] = (x + [[1/x]])^3 - 3(x + [[1/x]])\n= (√29)^3 - 3√29\n= 29√29 - 3√29 = 26√29\nx^3 - [[1/x^3]] = (x - [[1/x]])^3 + 3(x - [[1/x]])\n= (5)^3 + 3(5) = 140\nx^6 - [[1/x^6]] = (x^3 - [[1/x^3]])(x^3 + [[1/x^3]])\n= 140 × 26√29 = 3640√29\n≈ 19602"
