                "a": "(x + [[1/x]])^2 = (3)^2\nx^2 + 2 + [[1/x^2]] = 9\nx^2 + [[1/x^2]] = 7\n(x^2 + [[1/x^2]])^2 = (7)^2\nx^4 + 2 + [[1/x^4]] = 49\nx^4 + [[1/x^4]] = 47\n(x - [[1/x]])^2 = x^2 - 2 + [[1/x^2]] = 5\nx - [[1/x]] = √5\nx^4 - [[1/x^4]] = (x^2 + [[1/x^2]])(x^2 - [[1/x^2]])\nx^2 - [[1/x^2]] = (x + [[1/x]])(x - [[1/x]]) = 3√5\nx^4 - [[1/x^4]] = 7 × 3√5 = 21√5\nx^3 + [[1/x^3]] = (x + [[1/x]])^3 - 3(x + [[1/x]])\n= (3)^3 - 3(3) = 18\nx^3 - [[1/x^3]] = (x - [[1/x]])^3 + 3(x - [[1/x]])\n= (√5)^3 + 3√5\n= 5√5 + 3√5 = 8√5\nx^6 - [[1/x^6]] = (x^3 + [[1/x^3]])(x^3 - [[1/x^3]])\n= 18 × 8√5 = 144√5\n≈ 322"
