                "a": "(i) S = [[10 + 10 + 12/2]] = [[32/2]] = 16 cm\n△ABC = √(S(S - a)(S - b)(S - c))\n= √(16 × (16 - 10) × (16 - 10) × (16 - 12))\n= √(16 × 6 × 6 × 4) = √2304\n= √(2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 3 × 3) = 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 3 = 48 cm^2\n(ii) S = [[12 + 12 + 16/2]] = [[40/2]] = 20 cm\n△DCE = √(S(S - d)(S - c)(S - e))\n= √(20 × (20 - 12) × (20 - 12) × (20 - 16))\n= √(20 × 8 × 8 × 4) = √5120\n= √(256 × 20) = 16√20\n= 16 × 4.472 = 71.55 cm^2\n(iii) S = [[9 + 9 + 12/2]] = [[30/2]] = 15 cm\n△LMN = √(S(S - l)(S - m)(S - n))\n= √(15 × (15 - 9) × (15 - 9) × (15 - 12))\n= √(15 × 6 × 6 × 3) = √1620\n= √(81 × 20) = 9√20\n= 9 × 4.472 = 40.25 cm^2\n(iv) S = [[24 + 24 + 40/2]] = [[88/2]] = 44 cm\n△PQR = √(S(S - p)(S - q)(S - r))\n= √(44 × (44 - 24) × (44 - 24) × (44 - 40))\n= √(44 × 20 × 20 × 4) = √70400\n= √(6400 × 11) = 80√11\n= 80 × 3.3166 = 265.33 cm^2"
