                "a": "(i) S = [[a + b + c/2]]\n20 = [[13 + 15 + c/2]]\n40 = 28 + c\nc = 40 - 28 = 12 cm\n△ABC = √(S(S - a)(S - b)(S - c))\n= √(20 × (20 - 13) × (20 - 15) × (20 - 12))\n= √(20 × 7 × 5 × 8) = √5600\n= √(100 × 56) = 10√56\n= 10 × 7.483 = 74.83 cm^2\n(ii) S = [[d + e + f/2]]\n6.0 = [[3.6 + 4.5 + f/2]]\n12 = 8.1 + f\nf = 12 - 8.1 = 3.9 cm\n△DEF = √(S(S - d)(S - e)(S - f))\n= √(6 × (6 - 3.6) × (6 - 4.5) × (6 - 3.9))\n= √(6 × 2.4 × 1.5 × 2.1) = √45.36 = 6.73 cm^2\n(iii) S = [[l + m + n/2]]\n10.0 = [[7.2 + 6.4 + n/2]]\n20 = 13.6 + n\nn = 20 - 13.6 = 6.4 cm\n△LMN = √(S(S - l)(S - m)(S - n))\n= √(10 × (10 - 7.2) × (10 - 6.4) × (10 - 6.4))\n= √(10 × 2.8 × 3.6 × 3.6) = √362.88 = 19.05 cm^2\n(iv) S = [[p + q + r/2]]\n7.0 = [[4.5 + 4.5 + r/2]]\n14 = 9 + r\nr = 14 - 9 = 5 cm\n△PQR = √(S(S - p)(S - q)(S - r))\n= √(7 × (7 - 4.5) × (7 - 4.5) × (7 - 5))\n= √(7 × 2.5 × 2.5 × 2) = √87.5\n= √(25 × 3.5) = 5√3.5\n= 5 × 1.8708 = 9.35 cm^2"
