                "q": "1. In the figure of Theorem 1.\n(i) Name the angle which is supplement of ∠BOC\n(ii) Name the angle which is complement of ∠BOC\n(iii) If m∠BOC = 50°, find measures of its complement and supplement.",
                "a": "(i) ∠AOC\n(ii) ∠POC\n(iii) Complement of ∠BOC = 90° − 50°\n= 40°\nSupplement of ∠BOC = 180° − 50°\n= 130°"
