                "a": "m∠AOD + m∠COD + m∠BOC = 180°\n2x + 3x + 45° = 180°\n5x + 45° = 180°\n5x = 180° − 45°\n5x = 135°\nx = 27°\nm∠AOD = 2x = 2 × 27° = 54°\nm∠COD = 3x = 3 × 27° = 81°\nm∠AOC = m∠AOD + m∠COD\nm∠AOC = 54° + 81°\nm∠AOC = 135°"
