                "a": "(a) m∠BOC + m∠BOD = 180°\n40° + w = 180°\nw = 180° − 40°\nw = 140°\nm∠BOD = 140°\nm∠AOC + m∠BOC = 180°\ny + 40° = 180°\ny = 180° − 40°\ny = 140°\nm∠AOC = 140°\nm∠AOD + m∠BOD = 180°\nz + 140° = 180°\nz = 180° − 140°\nz = 40°\nm∠AOD = 40°\n(b) m∠BOC + m∠BOD = 180°\n45° + m∠BOD = 180°\nm∠BOD = 180° − 45°\nm∠BOD = 135°\nm∠AOC + m∠BOC = 180°\nm∠AOC + 45° = 180°\nm∠AOC = 180° − 45°\nm∠AOC = 135°\nm∠AOD + m∠BOD = 180°\nm∠AOD + 135° = 180°\nm∠AOD = 180° − 135°\nm∠AOD = 45°"
