                "a": "∠1 and ∠2 are vertically opposite angles\n∠1 ≅ ∠2\n∠3 and ∠4 are vertically opposite angles\n∠3 ≅ ∠4\n∠1 ≅ ∠3\n∠2 ≅ ∠4"
