                "a": "∠AOB ≅ ∠COD\nOE is the bisector of ∠AOB\nOF is the bisector of ∠COD\nEOF is a straight line\nm∠AOE = [[1/2]]m∠AOB\nm∠COF = [[1/2]]m∠COD\nm∠AOB = m∠COD\nm∠AOE = m∠COF\nm∠EOC + m∠COF = 180°\nm∠AOC = m∠AOE + m∠EOC\nm∠AOC = m∠COF + m∠EOC\nm∠AOC = 180°\nA, O, C are in a straight line\nm∠BOE = [[1/2]]m∠AOB\nm∠DOF = [[1/2]]m∠COD\nm∠BOE = m∠DOF\nm∠EOD + m∠DOF = 180°\nm∠BOD = m∠BOE + m∠EOD\nm∠BOD = m∠DOF + m∠EOD\nm∠BOD = 180°\nB, O, D are in a straight line\nAOC and BOD are two intersecting lines"
