                "q": "1. In the adjacent figure, O is the mid point of line segments AB and CD.\nProve that AC ≅ BD\n[Hint: Join point A to point C and point B to point D. Prove △AOC ≅ △BOD by S.A.S. ≅ S.A.S.]",
