                "a": "X̄_w = [[Σxw/Σw]]\nΣxw = (25 × 12) + (30 × 8) + (60 × 5) + (40 × 3) + (80 × 4)\n= 300 + 240 + 300 + 120 + 320\n= 1280\nΣw = 12 + 8 + 5 + 3 + 4\n= 32\nX̄_w = [[1280/32]]\n= 40\nRs 40 per kg"
