                "a": "Mathematics\nΣxw = (10 × 5) + (20 × 4) + (30 × 7) + (40 × 8) + (50 × 6) + (60 × 3) + (70 × 4) + (80 × 5) + (90 × 3)\n= 50 + 80 + 210 + 320 + 300 + 180 + 280 + 400 + 270\n= 2090\nΣw = 5 + 4 + 7 + 8 + 6 + 3 + 4 + 5 + 3\n= 45\nX̄_w = [[2090/45]]\n= [[418/9]]\n= 46.44\nScience\nΣxw = (10 × 4) + (20 × 4) + (30 × 8) + (40 × 8) + (50 × 5) + (60 × 3) + (70 × 2) + (80 × 7) + (90 × 4)\n= 40 + 80 + 240 + 320 + 250 + 180 + 140 + 560 + 360\n= 2170\nΣw = 4 + 4 + 8 + 8 + 5 + 3 + 2 + 7 + 4\n= 45\nX̄_w = [[2170/45]]\n= [[434/9]]\n= 48.22\n48.22 > 46.44\nScience"
