                "q": "If U = {1, 2, 3, ..., 12}, A = {1, 2, 3, ..., 10}, B = {2, 4, 6, ..., 12} and C = {1, 3, 5, 7, ..., 11} then find the following:\n(i) A ∪ B (ii) A ∩ B (iii) A − B (iv) (A ∩ C)' (v) (B ∪ C)' (vi) B' ∩ C' (vii) A − B' (viii) B − A' (ix) A' − C (x) (B − C)' (xi) (C − A)' (xii) A' − C'"
